globs: **/*.ts,**/*.tsx
alwaysApply: false
---
# TypeScript

- Prefer functional-first code; avoid classes unless the codebase is class-heavy in this area.
- Prefer explicit types at boundaries (public functions, IO, API handlers); avoid `any` (use `unknown` + narrowing when needed).
- Keep changes minimal-churn; don’t reformat unrelated blocks.
- Use existing repo patterns for error handling (Result/throw) and keep errors actionable.
